      "uid": "zhcn:cf95f6fb05878ab2f99f3f63",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一直以来谢谢你了！\\n跟着我这种全力猛冲的人\\n不容易吧。不过，果然\\n我还是想和你一起努力啊。\\n所以，今后也拜托你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11a70e6ae9b1d8e4c35138274d576b4d7fda198aca751c8d6486413e8afcb404",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "271",
        "110402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31eb9d7eced3d683b6e34953",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈喽　这是给你的\\n间隔22分的“FRB”\\n会在古老的信中写下『Wow!』\\n哈喽　希望能传达给你",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f9d8de1a9773ada8a529c452283078ed889b1b88b113ba9a088d0afa4340d3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "271",
        "110501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2232c3387ebda79122123d83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈喽　这是给你的\\n间隔22分的“FRB”\\n会在古老的信中写下『Wow!』\\n哈喽　希望能传达给你",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f9d8de1a9773ada8a529c452283078ed889b1b88b113ba9a088d0afa4340d3d",
